### NutritionAssistant (MAF). Set @host from the Aspire dashboard's "api" endpoint.
### The assistant is live only when a provider is configured (e.g. OPENAI_API_KEY set);
### otherwise /chat returns 503 by design.
@host = https://localhost:7443
@subject = demo-user

### Is a chat provider configured?
GET {{host}}/api/v1/assistant/status
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}

### Ask the assistant — it calls read tools (search/targets/today/profile); code owns the numbers.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/assistant/chat
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "How many calories do I have left today, and what's my protein target?" }

### Another turn (the conversation is persisted per user)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/assistant/chat
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "Find me some high-protein foods." }

### Clear the conversation
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/assistant/session
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}
